{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_04_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e3b6304f56e20142af847b60eb087c50d3a9b8dcc7d4937fc3c49e76b470ed0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86a51634775f75fb426f34c9ca8d026a4eb2125307f109c342cf6e50a0536289",
      "text": "我哥哥因为工作关系，会接触到演艺圈的人～\n在听哥哥聊那些事情的过程中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:175fd2424a8335b0b3c5251ec662a809b61cad5bfc407dc92cbb1d4c71ad8aa1",
      "text": "对能接纳各种个性的、\n偶像的世界产生了兴趣～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee3db4dc8e8cfa4f919ec43a8f3bdcdcf296dee9968ac33329be1f967010e62f",
      "text": "不伪装自己，自由自在地表现，\n同时赚取生活所需的金钱……这种事，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3fba26bc0e39c7f80ddb86b5c160106acdf2e3fceb712b4a7749ac24e47d5eb",
      "text": "在普通的社会里，是很困难的事情呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a9aa910d5f51281c602b8cead5e6de893673ed73e3282f1d90827f33c4fce24",
      "text": "（不仅有现实的想法，\n还能感受到想要开拓未来的坚强意志……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfb8a546663e4942dc8c5ca50189fb5417643d68a8c0322c71eabba4d55a490",
      "text": "（他一定也，能够吸引很多人！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b079068c76516032c6ac3c3f41250e24ee60da28164ee702cf0db906b2f3e2be",
      "text": "虽然类型不同，\n但两位都是很有个性的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8727bd0a4e0798c198f439890e9d8af91f93df4f9dd27b9a004f1c99177aca4",
      "text": "是的！两位都合格了。\n重新把两位叫进来，宣布结果吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3851724537edc005fc50f3a58e08ccc9e23bd6dd4d2329b2e02922697348a2e2",
      "text": "（说到个性……\n那位男性也散发着独特的气场呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df9f4a9fd7055909c250b5454d6dfd2406696acaa64ac3b7187daeaab9e8466b",
      "text": "啊，多谢了。要是有兴趣的话吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e61328d616a1d306399e27a9cfc2a109b5fe608155ea24fe44743796fd2eb10",
      "text": "我接下来要回去工作了，\n你也路上小心回去吧。再见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
